  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Numbers",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 27,
    "summary": "The law of inheritances to sons, daughters, and kinsmen is explained—Moses will see but not enter the promised land—Joshua is called and set apart to lead Israel.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Then came the daughters of Zelophehad, the son of Hepher, the son of Gilead, the son of Machir, the son of Manasseh, of the families of Manasseh the son of Joseph: and these are the names of his daughters; Mahlah, Noah, and Hoglah, and Milcah, and Tirzah.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 174,
            "end": 177
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 27:1",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And they stood before Moses, and before Eleazar the priest, and before the princes and all the congregation, by the door of the tabernacle of the congregation, saying,",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 75,
            "end": 82,
            "text": "HEB leaders, rulers."
          },
          {
            "start": 128,
            "end": 158,
            "text": "HEB tent of meeting."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 109,
            "end": 111
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 27:2",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Our father died in the wilderness, and he was not in the company of them that gathered themselves together against the Lord in the company of Korah; but died in his own sin, and had no sons.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 27:3",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Why should the name of our father be done away from among his family, because he hath no son? Give unto us therefore a possession among the brethren of our father.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 107,
            "end": 116
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 27:4",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "And Moses brought their cause before the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 27:5",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "And the Lord spake unto Moses, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 27:6",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "The daughters of Zelophehad speak right: thou shalt surely give them a possession of an inheritance among their father’s brethren; and thou shalt cause the inheritance of their father to pass unto them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 88,
            "end": 99,
            "text": "Num. 36:2 (1–13); Josh. 17:4."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 27:7",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And thou shalt speak unto the children of Israel, saying, If a man die, and have no son, then ye shall cause his inheritance to pass unto his daughter.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 27:8",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And if he have no daughter, then ye shall give his inheritance unto his brethren.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 27:9",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And if he have no brethren, then ye shall give his inheritance unto his father’s brethren.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 27:10",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And if his father have no brethren, then ye shall give his inheritance unto his kinsman that is next to him of his family, and he shall possess it: and it shall be unto the children of Israel a statute of judgment, as the Lord commanded Moses.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 194,
            "end": 213,
            "text": "HEB statutory law."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 27:11",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And the Lord said unto Moses, Get thee up into this mount Abarim, and see the land which I have given unto the children of Israel.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 58,
            "end": 64,
            "text": "Deut. 32:49 (48–52)."
          },
          {
            "start": 78,
            "end": 82,
            "text": "TG Promised Lands."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Promised Lands.",
            "prettyString": "TG Promised Lands",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Promised Lands",
                "entryId": "tg-promised-lands",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
